  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal, multiprofile configurations with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_001: 0.725). This experiment tests the impact of switching the RNA encoder to scgpt while keeping the image encoder, aggregation (transformer), and fusion (concat) consistent. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder choice, which is critical for understanding performance differences, even though scgpt has lower prior performance. It balances exploration of key design choices without overcomplicating the experiment."
}

